    },

    {
      "id": "s4-massive-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1820, "y": 720,
      "width": 240, "height": 200,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#862e9c", "backgroundColor": "#f3d9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae10"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-massive-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1828, "y": 726,
      "width": 224, "height": 188,
      "text": "ACLI / Ischemic Hepatitis\n(two-hit model)\n\nDx clues:\n• ALT:LDH < 1.5\n• Rapid rise 1–3 days\n• ≥50% fall within 72h\n  of hemo stabilization\n• ~80-84% show ≥50%\n  drop in prothrombin\n  activity (vs viral)\n\nRx: Restore CO\n→ Inotropes, MCS\n→ O₂ if hypoxemic",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae11"
    },

    {
      "id": "s4-mod-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2080, "y": 720,
      "width": 200, "height": 200,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#862e9c", "backgroundColor": "#f3d9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae12"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-mod-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2088, "y": 726,
      "width": 184, "height": 188,
      "text": "Broader differential:\n• DILI\n• Viral hepatitis\n  (ALT:LDH >1.5)\n• Autoimmune\n  hepatitis\n• Ischemic hepatitis\n  with partial\n  recovery\n• Sepsis\n\nCheck: ALT:LDH\nHep panel, ANA,\nASMA, med review",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae13"
    },

    {
      "id": "s4-mild-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2320, "y": 720,
      "width": 200, "height": 200,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#862e9c", "backgroundColor": "#f3d9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae14"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-mild-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2328, "y": 726,
      "width": 184, "height": 188,
      "text": "Nonspecific / low\npriority alone:\n• Congestive\n  hepatopathy\n• NAFLD/NASH\n• Thyroid dz\n• Celiac disease\n• Strenuous exercise\n\nContext-dependent:\nif persists or rises\n→ full workup;\nif isolated mild\n→ monitor",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae15"
    },

    {
      "id": "s4-kinetics-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1900, "y": 940,
      "width": 560, "height": 110,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#862e9c", "backgroundColor": "#f3d9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae16"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-kinetics-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1910, "y": 948,
      "width": 540, "height": 96,
      "text": "STEP 3: Assess Kinetics\n• ACLI: rapid rise 1–3 days → ≥50% fall within 72h of hemo stabilization\n  → normalization 7–10 days\n• Failure to decline after hemodynamic stabilization → reassess for\n  ongoing ischemia, DILI, viral hepatitis, or primary liver disease\n\nNote on low AST/ALT: may indicate pyridoxine (B6) deficiency\n(ALT is pyridoxal-phosphate dependent) or advanced sarcopenia/cachexia",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae17"
    },

    {
      "id": "s4-prog-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1900, "y": 1070,
      "width": 560, "height": 60,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae18"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-prog-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1910, "y": 1078,
      "width": 540, "height": 46,
      "text": "PROGNOSIS (SURVIVE trial): Elevated transaminases → increased 31-day mortality\n(17.6% vs 8.4%) and 180-day mortality (31.6% vs 22.4%) in ADHF [Nikolaou 2013]\nAssociated with clinical signs of hypoperfusion.",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "ae19"
    },

    {
      "id": "sec5-hdr",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40, "y": 1350,
      "width": 580, "height": 36,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#c92a2a",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "af0"
    },
    {
      "id": "sec5-hdr-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50, "y": 1360,
      "width": 560, "height": 16,
      "text": "SECTION 5 — LDH (LACTATE DEHYDROGENASE)",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "af1"
    },

    {
      "id": "s5-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40, "y": 1400,
      "width": 580, "height": 400,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "af2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50, "y": 1408,
      "width": 560, "height": 386,
      "text": "ELEVATED LDH\n\nContext-first interpretation (ubiquitous enzyme — always\ncorrelate with clinical picture):\n\nSTEP 1: What is the scenario?\n\n1. ACLI / Ischemic Hepatitis:\n   • LDH rises rapidly 10–20×ULN within 1–3 days\n   • ALT:LDH < 1.5 → favors cardiogenic over viral\n   • Often precedes or parallels transaminase elevation\n\n2. Hemolysis (mechanical):\n   • ↑LDH + ↓haptoglobin + ↑indirect bili + ↑retics\n   • LVAD, ECMO, mechanical valves, DIC\n\n3. Tissue ischemia / infarction:\n   • MI: LDH-1 > LDH-2 ("flipped" isoenzyme pattern)\n   • PE: LDH-3 predominance\n   • Mesenteric ischemia (LDH-5)\n\nSTEP 2: LDH vs Serum Lactate — KEY DISTINCTION\n   LDH = enzyme (tissue injury marker)\n   Lactate = metabolite (tissue hypoperfusion marker)\n   • Serial lactate trajectories (not single values) best\n     predict outcomes in cardiogenic shock\n   • Early clearance = reversible shock\n   • Persistent elevation = refractory shock or impaired\n     hepatic lactate clearance\n\nSTEP 3: Prognostic significance in HFrEF\n   • Higher LDH independently predicts worse outcomes\n     (GALACTIC-HF: Q4 vs Q1 HR 1.84 for HF event/CV death)\n   • Improves risk prediction when added to PREDICT-HF model\n\nLOW LDH: Rarely significant. LDH-A or LDH-B deficiency\n(rare genetic conditions). Not actionable in ICU.",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
