    },
    {
      "id": "refs-lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 412, "y": 2558,
      "width": 1576, "height": 148,
      "text": "Samsky MD et al. JACC 2013;61:2397 — Cardiohepatic Interactions in HF                    Xanthopoulos A et al. JACC HF 2019;7:87 — HF and Liver Disease\nKonstam MA et al. Circulation 2018;137:e578 — AHA RV Failure Statement                    Nikolaou M et al. Eur Heart J 2013;34:742 — LFT Abnormalities + ADHF (SURVIVE)\nStyczynski G et al. JASE 2016;29:132 — Echo Correlates of LFTs in HF (PVPI)              Ono R et al. JACC HF 2026 — LDH + Outcomes in HFrEF (GALACTIC-HF)\nAdamson C et al. Eur J HF 2022;24:1856 — Liver Tests + Outcomes (DAPA-HF)               Levy B et al. Ann Intensive Care 2026 — Lactate in Cardiogenic Shock\nSuzuki K et al. Eur J HF 2020;22:1662 — Sacubitril/Valsartan + LFTs (PARADIGM-HF)       El Iskandarani M et al. Medicine 2021 — Albumin in HF: Systematic Review\nGhazal M, Khalife WI. Heart Fail Rev 2025 — Hypoalbuminemia in HF                        Cheves JW et al. Transfusion 2021;61:2862 — Causes of Elevated INR in ICU\nOkada A et al. Circ J 2016;80:913 — Prognostic Value of INR in ADHF                       Lemmer A et al. Hepatology 2018;68:1633 — Advanced Fibrosis in Congestive Hepatopathy\nKwo PY et al. Am J Gastroenterol 2017;112:18 — ACG Guideline: Abnormal Liver Chemistries  Riancho JA. Calcif Tissue Int 2023 — Diagnostic Approach to Low ALP",
      "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
